    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1041">

                <pb facs="0780" n="664" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg664"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 125.8273/53b.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                            Brazilian Minister at Mexico City.
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-05-15">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">May 15, 1914</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Have you heard anything more of Silliman? If not, please bring to attention of
                    Foreign Office again and enquire whether promised order had reached Saltillo and
                    whether Silliman is on the way to Mexico City.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">W. J. Bryan</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
